schema: "0.4"
id: echo-of-manifestation-character-the-librarian
type: image
quality: medium

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art portrait of an older man known as the Librarian, standing in a
    vast dark archive that stretches into infinity behind him. He wears tattered scholar robes
    of deep burgundy and faded black, patched and resewn many times, with alchemical symbols
    embroidered in tarnished gold thread along the hems. Books and scrolls float in the
    darkness around him at various heights, their pages fluttering as if caught in an unseen
    breeze, some glowing faintly with amber script. His face is lined with centuries of
    accumulated knowledge and weariness — deep-set eyes behind cracked spectacles that reflect
    candlelight. A warm golden candlelight emanates from a candelabra beside him, creating a
    small island of warmth in the oppressive dark. His expression is erudite but profoundly
    weary, a man who has read every book in this archive and regrets most of what he learned.
    One hand rests on a massive tome, the other hangs at his side. Painterly style, atmospheric
    lighting, Rembrandt-quality chiaroscuro. The mood is forgotten knowledge and the weight
    of understanding.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, clean magic, wizard hat, staff, glowing magic, colorful palette, modern clothing, clean robes, low detail, flat shading"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1024
    height: 1536
    aspect_ratio: "2:3"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.7
  criteria:
    anatomy: {weight: 3, description: "Correct human/creature proportions, no extra limbs or malformed features"}
    prompt_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Key details from prompt present — clothing, expression, distinguishing features"}
    style_consistency: {weight: 2, description: "Dark fantasy painterly style, atmospheric lighting, appropriate color palette"}
    composition: {weight: 1, description: "Portrait framing, subject clearly readable, no cropping issues"}
  reject_if:
    - "extra fingers or limbs"
    - "anime or cartoon style"
    - "bright cheerful palette"

tags: [character, npc, librarian, scholar, portrait, concept-art, dark-fantasy]
